VER-TESTS-PASS: test_double_flaky fails on its first run and first rerun and passes on its second
rerun. A flaky test still fails the objective; TestPythonReruns reads the adapter evidence to check
it is marked flaky on rerun 2. The test counts only outside coverage.py, because
VER-COVERAGE-RESOLUTION runs it concurrently under `coverage run`, which sets COVERAGE_RUN.

